# Innocent Bystander: "Whenever this creature is dealt 3 or more damage, investigate." Ruling: it triggers only if dealt 3 or
# more at once; damage that adds up to 3 or more at different times does not. Bot1 holds a Mox Emerald and a Giant Growth, so
# in response to Bot2's first Shock the Bystander becomes 5/4. Each Shock deals it 2, four damage in all, which kills it, and
# neither is 3: no Clue. (CR 603.2c)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Innocent Bystander
Giant Growth
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Shock x2
Mountain x12

